    "body": "## What's Changed\n\n### ✨ Features / 新功能\n- complete issue #15 — /version, periodic update notify, pendingRestart, runtime-link drift check\n- doctor update reminder + guardian unit stability check + stable CLI entry (issue #15)\n\n### 📚 Documentation / 文档\n- phrase pending-restart hint conditionally\n\n### 🧪 Tests / 测试\n- pin /version test versions independent of release tag\n\n### 🚀 Release / 发布\n- v0.14.0 (issue #15 update experience & hot management)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/PlutoKeating/dsh-lark-bot/compare/v0.13.1...v0.14.0\n"
