    "body": "## What's Changed\n\n### ✨ Features / 新功能\n- add /newg to auto-create a group chat and start a fresh session\n- declare package.json#dshWorkshop intake manifest (harness-profile profile bundle)\n\n### 🐛 Fixes / 修复\n- harden session self-heal with anchored classification and copy-first archiving (issue #13)\n- harden auto-relaunch with readiness window, pre-spawn re-check and pid convergence (issue #12)\n- resolve pnpm via cross-spawn so Windows finds pnpm.cmd (issue #7)\n\n### 📚 Documentation / 文档\n- document guardian auto-relaunch readiness and session heal hardening (issues #12/#13)\n- mark PR #11 as merged after cherry-picking /newg onto main\n- add author intro before the Contributors section\n- fix omdsh-dev community discussion links (#12 -> #11) in the community listing section\n- credit external contributors (PR #9 koprivnikarurnaa-oss, PR #11 Normanyin) in a Contributors section\n\n### 🚀 Release / 发布\n- v0.13.0 (PR #11 /newg, issue #7 Windows pnpm fix, guardian/session hardening)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/PlutoKeating/dsh-lark-bot/compare/v0.12.0...v0.13.0\n"
