    "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/PlutoKeating/dsh-lark-bot/tarball/v0.12.0",
    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/PlutoKeating/dsh-lark-bot/zipball/v0.12.0",
    "body": "## What's Changed\n\n### ✨ Features / 新功能\n- repair sdk/acp runtime-profile own-package links after package change (issue #10)\n- add dsh-lark-bot upgrade command reusing setup/doctor internals (issue #10)\n- version/state/detect/service modules for the one-command upgrade (issue #10)\n\n### 🐛 Fixes / 修复\n- run doctor checks against the bridge state profile, not the dsh runtime profile (issue #10)\n- detect dsh wrapper binaries by basename so running-instance checks work (issue #10)\n\n### 📚 Documentation / 文档\n- add DSH_LARK_UPGRADE_REGISTRY to the config table; record web adapter (issue #8/#9) and one-command upgrade (issue #10) requirements\n- CLI surface now includes the upgrade command (issue #10)\n- align version markers (upgrade is new in v0.12.0) and map upgrade/web modules\n- mention runtime-profile consistency repair in the upgrade flow (issue #10)\n- document the one-command upgrade flow (issue #10)\n- adopt dev-staging-production branch policy (v0.11.0+; feature->staging auto-merge, main requires human approval)\n\n### 🧪 Tests / 测试\n- cover runtime-profile link repair\n- cover versions, state, detection and the upgrade command\n\n### 🚀 Release / 发布\n- v0.12.0 (one-command upgrade mechanism and doc coverage refresh)\n\n### Other\n- refactor(guardian): export guardianServiceFilePath for upgrade detection reuse\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/PlutoKeating/dsh-lark-bot/compare/v0.11.0...v0.12.0\n"
