    "body": "## What's Changed\n\n### ✨ Features / 新功能\n- web session watcher - push web-GUI turn completions to Feishu and auto-switch\n- auto-relaunch the bridge when it is down\n- add web adapter that drives the local dsh web agent\n\n### 🐛 Fixes / 修复\n- self-heal v2 - only archive genuinely corrupt session logs\n\n### 📚 Documentation / 文档\n- document the web adapter, self-heal v2 env knobs and DSH_LARK_WEB_* variables\n- refresh community listing status after v0.10.2 follow-ups\n- document the web adapter in the architecture layering\n\n### 🧪 Tests / 测试\n- flush before rmdir to stop the ENOTEMPTY cleanup flake\n\n### 🚀 Release / 发布\n- v0.11.0 (web single-writer adapter, self-heal v2, guardian auto-relaunch)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/PlutoKeating/dsh-lark-bot/compare/v0.10.2...v0.11.0\n"
